# subject_verbs.voc — Third-person finite verbs that take a food noun as subject
# ('molho verde acompanha o peixe', 'molho de véspera sabe melhor'). Later in the
# clause they show the homograph is that subject, so it is the noun. Add 3rd-person
# finite forms only: infinitives follow 'para' after the verb ('molho para amaciar').
#
# Format: one term per line, lowercase; '#' starts a comment.

